// Project-specific Biome (GritQL) lint plugin: type scale guard.
//
// Flags `text-[Npx]` anywhere inside a `className`. An arbitrary pixel size is
// a decision made once, on one screen, against one font, and it does not
// travel. The frontend accumulated 190 of them across 70 files in twelve
// different sizes, which is how a product ends up with 141 distinct typography
// signatures and no two pages agreeing on what a section heading looks like.
//
// The replacement is `typeRole` in `frontend/src/lib/design/type-scale.ts`:
// eight named roles, base 14px, hierarchy carried by weight rather than by
// size. If none of the eight fits, the answer is a ninth role argued for in
// that module, not a pixel value inline.
//
// The type scale governs six entity surfaces. biome.json scopes this plugin to
// the three that carry no `text-[Npx]` today, so the rule holds them at zero:
// agents, LLM proxies and MCP gateways. The other three still have sites to
// lose before they can be added, and restyling them is its own change:
//
//   frontend/src/app/mcp/registry/**/*.tsx       35 sites
//   frontend/src/app/skills/**/*.tsx              9 sites
//   frontend/src/components/agent-pages/**/*.tsx  1 site
//
// Widen the `includes` list a surface at a time as each reaches zero. A surface
// that is not listed is not held to the scale, which is the honest state rather
// than a rule that has to be switched off to get a green build. The rest of the
// frontend is not held to it either, so this stays a boundary rather than a
// repo-wide sweep nobody finishes.
//
// Only `px` is flagged. `text-[0.8125rem]` and friends are not in use and are
// no better, but a regex that also banned them would catch `text-[var(--x)]`
// and other legitimate escapes; add them here if they ever show up.
//
// Plugin diagnostics are not suppressible via `biome-ignore`. A genuinely
// unavoidable size (matching a third-party widget's metrics, say) belongs in a
// named constant next to the code that needs it, with a comment saying why.
language js

jsx_attribute(name = $name, value = $value) where {
  $name <: "className",
  $value <: r"(?s).*text-\[[0-9]+px\].*",
  register_diagnostic(
    span = $value,
    message = "Arbitrary text sizes do not travel between pages. Use a role from `typeRole` in lib/design/type-scale.ts (page-title, page-description, section-title, label, body, meta, metric, code)."
  )
}
